title: "DAC-to-SNG case study: f-TRFu on a direct-air-capture to synthetic-natural-gas flowsheet"
abstract: "Grey-box model and scripts that reproduce the f-TRFu results of the DAC-to-SNG case study (Section 8.2) of the PhD thesis “Rigorous Trust-Region Algorithms for Surrogate-based Grey-box Optimisation”. The process model is adapted from Dolat et al., Applied Energy 384 (2025) 125413."
